# Stage 8 far layer (factor 3/16, y = 0): the mountains above Bad Ischl.
# The Katrin as a long lit f ridge rising from the valley to a jagged
# rocky summit (x ~290) with 1 px tree-tip serrations along the ridge
# line; one coherent F shadow mass right of the summit's stepped fall line
# (runs of 2-6 px every 3-6 rows), with narrow tapering f ribs (5 -> 2 px,
# irregular edges) from the second top (x ~360), the col and the eastern
# shoulder; forest texture (rows of short tree dashes, F on f and f on F)
# only below row 90, so the upper flanks and the summit stay plain and the
# cable car's line (a 1 px F diagonal to a tiny F top station) reads; the
# Siriuskogel as a small wooded hump in front (right) with the same
# stepped shadow and one rib; behind the col, a far glimpse of the
# Dachstein's peaks in h snow with f rock ribs.
# Colours f F h only (art-style 7), no k, no outlines. Tiles horizontally
# (the profile at x 639 meets x 0 at y 112).
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grid is the source.
sprite = bg_katrin
size   = 640x150
origin = 0,0
anim   = idle frames=1
---
frame idle 0
